    "body": "This is very exciting.  I hope it makes it so that we can write data to currently \"sensitive\" areas, such as the downloads folder.  (Streaming downloads is a major use case for filesystem access... and today users aren't even allowed to 'download' their own data to the location of their choice, if it happens to be considered a sensitive area.)",
